00:29:07,649 --> 00:29:10,949
1人ずつ来なよ、ほら。普通にほら、愛をね...
Come up one by one, come on. Normally, you know, with love...

294
00:29:10,949 --> 00:29:15,249
人が多くて行ききれない、ほら... 誰から？ほら...
There are too many people, I can't reach... Who's first? Come on...

295
00:29:15,249 --> 00:29:18,249
いや、えーっと...ママだよ。
No, uh... I'm your mama.

296
00:29:18,249 --> 00:29:20,649
おめでとう！ おめでとうじゃない！
Congratulations! Don't "congratulations" me!

297
00:29:20,649 --> 00:29:24,949
おめでとう！ この動き！ なにそれ！
Congratulations! Look at these moves! What is that?!

298
00:29:24,949 --> 00:29:28,449
もう、ほらちゃんとして！ 大丈夫？変な人いて怖かったでしょ？
Geez, come on, act proper! Are you okay? There was a weird person, scary, right?

299
00:29:28,449 --> 00:29:30,449
なんかおかしくね？ ママだよ。
Isn't something weird? I'm your mama.

300
00:29:30,449 --> 00:29:33,449
違うよ！違う！ ママなの！
No! You're wrong! I am your mama!

301
00:29:33,449 --> 00:29:39,449
おかしい... おかしい...
This is weird... so weird...

302
00:29:39,449 --> 00:29:43,449
ちょっと待って！ うちの事務所さ、なんかアレじゃないのよ。芸人じゃないのよ。
Wait a minute! Our agency isn't, like, that. We aren't comedians.

303
00:29:43,449 --> 00:29:46,449
溜まってたからビビった。 おーおー。
They were holding it in, so I was startled. Oh, oh.

304
00:29:46,449 --> 00:29:49,449
はい、これからも頼りになるお姉ちゃんに頼ってね！
Alright, rely on your dependable big sister from now on, okay?

305
00:29:49,449 --> 00:29:52,449
お姉ちゃんだと思ってるの？本当に？
Do you really think you're a big sister?

306
00:29:52,449 --> 00:29:55,449
おかしいよ！ おかしいよ！
That's weird! That's weird!

307
00:29:55,449 --> 00:29:59,249
ほら、ちゃんとほら、愛をね。最後にね、フツーにね。
Come on, properly, show some love. At the end, normally.

308
00:29:59,249 --> 00:30:01,649
いや、でもうちらーの「すーびび」の仲やんかー。 そうね！
Well, but we're in "SuuBibi" together, right? That's right!

309
00:30:01,649 --> 00:30:04,449
だから「せーの」って言ったら...
So if I say "Ready, set...", what will...

310
00:30:03,606 --> 00:30:04,906
分かったよな？
You got it, right?

311
00:30:04,906 --> 00:30:05,906
分かった！
Got it!

312
00:30:05,906 --> 00:30:07,106
行くよ！せーの！
Here we go! One, two...

313
00:30:07,106 --> 00:30:09,106
スリー、ツー、ワン...
Three, two, one...

314
00:30:09,606 --> 00:30:12,106
待って待って！
Wait, wait!

315
00:30:13,406 --> 00:30:14,406
もう一回！
One more time!

316
00:30:14,406 --> 00:30:17,606
せーの！スリー、ツー、ワン、サーイコー！
Ready, set! Three, two, one, awesome!

317
00:30:18,406 --> 00:30:21,106
ハート！これハートだよ！
A heart! This is a heart!

318
00:30:21,606 --> 00:30:23,806
大丈夫？届いてる？
Are you okay? Is it reaching?

319
00:30:23,806 --> 00:30:25,806
しっかりして！
Pull it together!

320
00:30:26,106 --> 00:30:29,106
ありがとう！みんなー！
Thank you, everyone!

321
00:30:29,106 --> 00:30:32,606
ママ、ママ良かったよー！
Mama, Mama, you were great!

322
00:30:32,606 --> 00:30:34,406
よかったよ！
You did great!

323
00:30:34,606 --> 00:30:38,606
ありがとう！バイバーイ！
Thank you! Bye-bye!

324
00:30:39,106 --> 00:30:41,106
対戦ありがとうございました！
Thanks for the great fight!

325
00:30:41,406 --> 00:30:42,906
何かうるさかったなー
Man, that was kinda noisy...

326
00:30:42,906 --> 00:30:44,806
頑張るか。よし！
Alright, let me do my best. Okay!

327
00:30:52,706 --> 00:30:56,106
くだらない愛の結果で
As a result of foolish love,

328
00:30:56,106 --> 00:30:59,606
僕らは生まれ落ちて
we were born into this world,

329
00:30:59,606 --> 00:31:03,906
呼吸すら強いられているけれど
forced even to just breathe, and yet...

330
00:31:03,906 --> 00:31:07,806
綺麗な言葉並べて
Lining up pretty words,

331
00:31:07,806 --> 00:31:11,106
醜さに蓋をして
putting a lid on the ugliness,

332
00:31:11,106 --> 00:31:15,406
自分を愛せないままだな
I still can't bring myself to love who I am.

333
00:31:19,606 --> 00:31:23,606
波に名前をつけること、僕らの呼吸に終わりがあること。
[Title: Nami ni Namae wo Tsukeru Koto, Bokura no Kokyuu ni Owari ga Aru Koto.]

334
00:31:27,106 --> 00:31:30,106
くだらない嘘をつくたび
Every time I tell a pointless lie,

335
00:31:30,106 --> 00:31:33,406
青い鱗 落ちた
a blue scale slips and falls away.

336
00:31:33,406 --> 00:31:37,406
ガラスの瞳が綺麗で
Those glass eyes are so beautiful.

337
00:31:38,106 --> 00:31:41,806
君のその盲目のように
Just like that blindness of yours,

338
00:31:41,806 --> 00:31:45,106
優しい人になってさ
if I could become a kind person...

339
00:31:45,106 --> 00:31:49,106
そんな僕を愛したいんだよ
I want to love a version of myself like that.

340
00:31:49,606 --> 00:31:53,606
私の呼吸に終わりがあること
Knowing that my breath will one day come to an end,

341
00:31:55,106 --> 00:31:59,606
君の声を覚えている
I still remember the sound of your voice.

342
00:32:01,106 --> 00:32:04,606
生まれては消えてゆくこと それだけを繰り返している
Being born and fading away—repeating only that over and over again.

343
00:32:06,606 --> 00:32:12,106
僕らがもしまた会えたらなんて思ってた
Thinking to myself, "What if we were able to meet again?"

344
00:32:12,106 --> 00:32:16,106
生まれては消えてゆくだけの 青い波に名前をつけることに
Giving a name to the blue waves that merely come into being and fade away...

345
00:32:19,106 --> 00:32:23,606
意味はなかったのかななんてさ
Wondering if there was ever any meaning to it at all...

346
00:32:44,406 --> 00:32:47,806
たわいない急ぎ足で
With innocent, hurried steps,

347
00:32:47,806 --> 00:32:51,406
積み木で遊んでいる
playing around with building blocks,

348
00:32:51,406 --> 00:32:55,106
崩れるその日を待っている
waiting for the day they fall apart.

349
00:32:55,606 --> 00:32:59,406
澄み切った夜の静寂
In the tranquility of a crystal-clear night,

350
00:32:59,406 --> 00:33:03,406
君の頬の紅色で
dyed in the crimson blush of your cheeks,

351
00:33:03,406 --> 00:33:07,406
もうすぐ桜が咲くだろう
the cherry blossoms will surely bloom soon.

352
00:33:07,406 --> 00:33:12,106
僕らの呼吸に意味がなくても
Even if there is no meaning to our breaths,

353
00:33:12,106 --> 00:33:17,106
二人はまた恋をする
the two of us will fall in love once more.

354
00:33:17,806 --> 00:33:23,606
生まれては消えてゆくこと それだけを繰り返している
Being born and fading away—repeating only that over and over again.

355
00:33:23,606 --> 00:33:29,106
そして君も夜の海に帰っていくんだろう
And you too will eventually return to the night ocean, won't you?

356
00:33:29,106 --> 00:33:33,106
生まれては消えてゆくだけの 青い波に名前をつけることに
Giving a name to the blue waves that merely come into being and fade away...

357
00:33:36,106 --> 00:33:40,106
囚われている
I am trapped by it all...

358
00:33:40,106 --> 00:33:45,106
覚えているかな いつかの春の朝に
Do you still remember? On that spring morning long ago,

359
00:33:46,606 --> 00:33:55,606
桜の木の下で約束したこと
the promise we made beneath the cherry blossom tree...

360
00:33:57,606 --> 00:34:01,606
思い出も君の名前も
Both my memories and your name,

361
00:34:01,606 --> 00:34:04,606
いつの日か失ってしまって
will one day be lost forever,

362
00:34:04,606 --> 00:34:09,106
僕もいつかこの海とひとつになるんだろう
and I too will someday become one with this sea.

363
00:34:09,106 --> 00:34:13,106
君のいない冬の空気
This winter air without you in it,

364
00:34:13,106 --> 00:34:18,606
僕の頬を刺すその痛みさえ愛していたい
I want to love even the pain that pierces my cheeks.

365
00:34:18,606 --> 00:34:24,106
生まれては消えてゆくこと それだけを繰り返している
Being born and fading away—repeating only that over and over again.

366
00:34:24,106 --> 00:34:29,606
僕らがもしまた会えたらなんて思ってた
Thinking to myself, "What if we were able to meet again?"

367
00:34:29,606 --> 00:34:33,606
生まれては消えてゆくだけの 青い波に名前をつけることに
Giving a name to the blue waves that merely come into being and fade away...

368
00:34:36,606 --> 00:34:41,606
意味はなかったのかな
Was there really no meaning to it at all...?

369
00:34:42,106 --> 00:34:47,606
こうして冬が終わって
Just like this, winter comes to an end,

370
00:34:47,606 --> 00:34:52,606
青い春が来る
and a blue spring arrives.

371
00:35:39,790 --> 00:35:40,390
UNHAPPY?

372
00:35:40,390 --> 00:35:41,590
悩める人の子よ
Oh child of man who grieves,

373
00:35:41,590 --> 00:35:42,190
UNLUCKY?

374
00:35:42,190 --> 00:35:43,390
人ならざる者も
Even those who are not human,

375
00:35:43,390 --> 00:35:43,990
BE HAPPY!

376
00:35:43,990 --> 00:35:45,190
弛まず目指せよ
Strive without faltering,

377
00:35:45,190 --> 00:35:46,490
生きているんだし
Since you're alive after all.

378
00:35:46,490 --> 00:35:47,990
目を逸らした過去も
The past you turned your eyes from,

379
00:35:47,990 --> 00:35:49,590
退屈な未来も
And the boring future, too,

380
00:35:49,590 --> 00:35:50,590
カウンセリング やれやれ
Counselling... oh dear, oh dear.

381
00:35:50,590 --> 00:35:51,590
古今東西
All times and places,

382
00:35:51,590 --> 00:35:52,190
一切合切
Everything and all,

383
00:35:52,190 --> 00:35:53,090
ピース ピース
Peace, peace.

384
00:35:53,090 --> 00:35:54,090
UNHAPPY?

385
00:35:54,090 --> 00:35:55,190
UNLUCKY?

386
00:35:55,190 --> 00:35:56,890
BE HAPPY!

387
00:35:56,890 --> 00:35:59,890
UNDEAD

388
00:36:05,490 --> 00:36:06,690
ねぇねぇねぇねぇ
Hey, hey, hey, hey,

389
00:36:06,690 --> 00:36:07,690
何だかどうして
Somehow, why is it,

390
00:36:07,690 --> 00:36:10,090
戦ってるようなそんな気がするの
It feels like we're fighting?

391
00:36:10,090 --> 00:36:11,190
触れられない
Can't touch it,

392
00:36:11,190 --> 00:36:12,090
触れたくもない
Don't want to touch it,

393
00:36:12,090 --> 00:36:13,890
過去の自分自分自分自分と
With the past self, self, self, self.

394
00:36:13,890 --> 00:36:15,090
もうとっくに死んでる
Already long dead,

395
00:36:15,090 --> 00:36:16,890
透明な亡霊と対決
Confronting a transparent ghost.

396
00:36:16,890 --> 00:36:19,390
幼気で痛い記憶の奥
Deep in the innocent, painful memories.

397
00:36:19,390 --> 00:36:20,390
残念？
Regrettable?

398
00:36:20,390 --> 00:36:21,590
もう居ないのに
Even though it's no longer here,

399
00:36:21,590 --> 00:36:22,590
あれ？そっちが良い？
Huh? You prefer that side?

400
00:36:22,590 --> 00:36:23,690
アイロニーね
What irony,

401
00:36:23,690 --> 00:36:26,290
透かされているのは現在の自分？
Is the one being seen through my current self?

402
00:36:26,290 --> 00:36:27,390
ナンセンス
Nonsense,

403
00:36:27,390 --> 00:36:28,790
消えないレッテル
A label that won't disappear,

404
00:36:28,790 --> 00:36:29,590
要はコンプレックス
In short, a complex.

405
00:36:29,590 --> 00:36:31,890
取り憑かれているみたい
It seems like I'm possessed,

406
00:36:31,890 --> 00:36:33,590
巻き付いたまま
Still wrapped around me,

407
00:36:33,590 --> 00:36:35,390
まだ離れない
Still won't let go,

408
00:36:35,390 --> 00:36:38,290
在りし日の自分
The self of former days.

409
00:36:38,590 --> 00:36:39,890
UNDEAD 死んじゃない
UNDEAD, not dead,

410
00:36:39,890 --> 00:36:42,390
お前とお前の連鎖
The chain of you and yourself.

411
00:36:42,390 --> 00:36:46,290
生きていることとは変わり続けることだ
Living means continuing to change.

412
00:36:46,290 --> 00:36:48,890
不幸に甘んじて満足するなよ
Don't settle for unhappiness and be satisfied.

413
00:36:48,890 --> 00:36:53,190
幸せになろうとしないなんて卑怯だ
It's cowardly to not even try to be happy.

414
00:36:53,190 --> 00:36:56,390
この世 この世は奇怪奇怪ファンタジー
This world, this world is a strange, strange fantasy.

415
00:36:56,390 --> 00:36:59,190
次は何が出るか 鬼が出るか蛇が出るか
What will come next? A demon, or a snake?

416
00:36:59,190 --> 00:37:02,190
出会って遭ってやっと始まる物語
Meeting and encountering, the story finally begins.

417
00:37:02,190 --> 00:37:03,890
さあ 人か化物か
Now, human or monster?

418
00:37:03,890 --> 00:37:05,190
閑話休題
Putting all that aside,

419
00:37:05,190 --> 00:37:06,690
ピース ピース
Peace, peace.

420
00:37:06,690 --> 00:37:09,590
Past & Future Can't change the past

421
00:37:09,590 --> 00:37:12,790
Past & Future Run for the future

422
00:37:12,790 --> 00:37:13,890
カットイン
Cut-in.

423
00:37:13,890 --> 00:37:14,990
何だかどうして
Somehow, why is it,

424
00:37:14,990 --> 00:37:16,890
未来になんぞ
In the future,

425
00:37:16,890 --> 00:37:19,990
何の希望もない 期待できないような気がして
Feeling like there's no hope, nothing to expect?

426
00:37:19,990 --> 00:37:21,390
もう随分生きている
Have been living for quite a while,

427
00:37:21,390 --> 00:37:23,390
既視感とテンプレで食傷
Sick of deja vu and cliché templates,

428
00:37:23,390 --> 00:37:26,290
素敵な出来事の気配もない
Not even a sign of wonderful events happening.

429
00:37:26,290 --> 00:37:27,290
残念
Regrettable,

430
00:37:27,290 --> 00:37:29,690
積んだ経験の因果
The karma of accumulated experiences,

431
00:37:29,690 --> 00:37:31,190
形骸化された神話と退屈な進化
Empty myths and boring evolution.

432
00:37:31,190 --> 00:37:32,190
要は刺激が欲しいんだ
In short, I just want stimulation,

433
00:37:32,190 --> 00:37:33,490
飽きちゃった 慣れちゃったなんて
Saying "I got bored, got used to it".

434
00:37:33,490 --> 00:37:34,790
整っていくガイダンス
Guidance falling into order,

435
00:37:34,790 --> 00:37:36,590
増えるコンプライアンス
Increasing compliance,

436
00:37:36,590 --> 00:37:38,090
蓋されていくみたい
Seems like it's being capped off,

437
00:37:38,090 --> 00:37:39,790
吸い尽くして
Sucking it dry,

438
00:37:39,790 --> 00:37:44,790
あれもこれもどれも同じ味がする
That, this, and everything all tastes the same.

439
00:37:44,790 --> 00:37:46,890
UNDEAD 死んじゃない
UNDEAD, not dead,

440
00:37:46,890 --> 00:37:48,890
お前とお前の連鎖
The chain of you and yourself.

441
00:37:48,890 --> 00:37:52,790
何時の世も 過去も未来も現在にあるんだ
In any era, past and future exist in the present.

442
00:37:52,790 --> 00:37:56,190
生きていることを愚直に果せよ
Fulfill the act of living with honest determination.

443
00:37:56,190 --> 00:37:58,390
目指せハッピーエンド
Aim for a happy ending!

444
00:37:58,390 --> 00:37:59,890
UNDEAD 死んじゃない
UNDEAD, not dead,

445
00:37:59,890 --> 00:38:02,190
お前に言っているんだ
I'm talking to you.

446
00:38:02,190 --> 00:38:05,790
幸せを諦めてしまうな 人で在れ
Don't give up on happiness; remain human.

447
00:38:05,790 --> 00:38:09,390
ただ苦しみに慣れて耐えているだけじゃ
If you're just getting used to pain and enduring it,

448
00:38:09,390 --> 00:38:12,790
死んでいるも同然 屍のアンデッド
You're as good as dead, a corpse of an undead.

449
00:38:12,790 --> 00:38:14,190
UNHAPPY? 悩める人の子よ
UNHAPPY? Oh child of man who grieves,

450
00:38:14,190 --> 00:38:15,890
UNLUCKY? 人ならざる者も
UNLUCKY? Even those who are not human,

451
00:38:15,890 --> 00:38:18,390
BE HAPPY! 弛まず目指せよ
BE HAPPY! Strive without faltering,

452
00:38:18,390 --> 00:38:19,590
生きているんだろ
You are alive, aren't you?

453
00:38:19,590 --> 00:38:22,090
不幸に浸るも 幸せになるのも
Drowning in misery or becoming happy,

454
00:38:22,090 --> 00:38:24,590
そう全部全部お前だ
Yes, it's all, all up to you.

455
00:38:24,590 --> 00:38:25,790
古今東西 一切合切
All times and places, everything and all,

456
00:38:25,790 --> 00:38:28,490
森羅万象 ピース ピース
All creation, peace, peace.

457
00:38:28,490 --> 00:38:31,390
Past & Future Can't change the past

458
00:38:31,390 --> 00:38:34,790
Past & Future Run for the future

459
00:38:34,790 --> 00:38:37,590
人の在る所に 眠るということ
Sleeping where humans exist,

460
00:38:37,590 --> 00:38:41,390
生き抜け 化物ばかりの物語
Survive through this story full of monsters!

461
00:39:05,790 --> 00:39:08,190
ちょっとやんちゃで
A little mischievous,

462
00:39:08,190 --> 00:39:10,590
ニコッと元気な
With a bright smile and full of energy,

463
00:39:10,590 --> 00:39:12,390
キラッとスマイル アイドル
A sparkling smile idol!

464
00:39:12,390 --> 00:39:15,490
毎日をもっと楽しくしたいんだ
Wanting to make every single day more fun,

465
00:39:15,490 --> 00:39:20,190
Join us with adventure!

466
00:39:20,190 --> 00:39:23,390
ひらひらスカートも
Even fluttering skirts,

467
00:39:23,390 --> 00:39:28,190
ちゃんと着こなしているんだよ
I wear them stylishly, you know!

468
00:39:28,190 --> 00:39:31,490
だからもっともっと好きになってもいいよ
So it's okay to fall in love with me even more!

469
00:39:31,490 --> 00:39:33,790
一緒に
Together,

470
00:39:33,790 --> 00:39:37,390
大空に飛び立とう
Let's take flight into the open sky!

471
00:39:37,390 --> 00:39:43,090
光るスターライト そんな輝きの中でも強いきらめき
Shining starlight, a strong sparkle even amidst that radiance!

472
00:39:43,090 --> 00:39:47,290
君に届いているかな
Is it reaching you, I wonder?

473
00:39:47,290 --> 00:39:50,790
1ミリでも伝わればいいな
If even a single millimeter conveys, that's enough!

474
00:39:50,790 --> 00:39:56,390
